{"seq":3,"slug":"matrix-factorization","title":"矩阵分解进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/collaborative-filtering/matrix-factorization","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"矩阵分解进阶\">矩阵分解进阶</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>矩阵分解进阶涵盖了在基础 SVD 之上发展出的一系列改进方法，这些方法通过引入更丰富的信号（隐式反馈、时间动态、社交网络）和更灵活的模型结构来提升推荐效果。SVD++ 将隐式反馈作为额外信号注入模型，TimeSVD++ 捕获用户偏好随时间的漂移，非负矩阵分解（NMF）约束因子非负以增强可解释性。这些方法构成了从传统矩阵分解到深度学习推荐的过渡桥梁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[基础矩阵分解] --&gt; B[SVD++]&#10;    A --&gt; C[TimeSVD++]&#10;    A --&gt; D[NMF]&#10;    A --&gt; E[因子化机器 FM]&#10;    B --&gt; F[显式+隐式信号融合]&#10;    C --&gt; G[时间动态建模]&#10;    D --&gt; H[非负可解释因子]&#10;    E --&gt; I[任意特征交互]\">graph TD\n    A[基础矩阵分解] --&gt; B[SVD++]\n    A --&gt; C[TimeSVD++]\n    A --&gt; D[NMF]\n    A --&gt; E[因子化机器 FM]\n    B --&gt; F[显式+隐式信号融合]\n    C --&gt; G[时间动态建模]\n    D --&gt; H[非负可解释因子]\n    E --&gt; I[任意特征交互]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>额外信号</th>\n<th>核心改进</th>\n<th>Netflix RMSE 提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Funk-SVD</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>0.9514</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SVD++</td>\n<td>隐式反馈</td>\n<td>用户隐式行为增强</td>\n<td>0.9065</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TimeSVD++</td>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>时变偏置和因子</td>\n<td>0.8952</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NMF</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>非负约束可解释</td>\n<td>0.963</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FM</td>\n<td>任意特征</td>\n<td>特征交互泛化</td>\n<td>视数据而定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"svd-与隐式反馈增强\">SVD++ 与隐式反馈增强</h2><p>SVD++ 的核心洞察是：用户对哪些物品有过交互本身就包含偏好信息，即使没有显式评分。例如，用户看过科幻片 A、B、C（即使没有评分），这一行为本身就暗示了对科幻片的偏好。SVD++ 为每个物品额外学习一个隐式因子向量 y_i，用户的最终表示是显式因子加上所有交互物品隐式因子的聚合。</p>\n<p>预测公式为：<code>r̂_ui = μ + b_u + b_i + q_i^T(p_u + |I_u|^{-1/2} Σ_{j∈I_u} y_j)</code>，其中 I_u 是用户 u 交互过的所有物品集合。隐式因子的聚合使用均方根归一化 <code>|I_u|^{-1/2}</code> 来消除活跃度差异的影响。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SVDPlusPlusConfig {&#10;  readonly factors: number;&#10;  readonly learningRate: number;&#10;  readonly regularization: number;&#10;  readonly epochs: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SVDPlusPlusModel {&#10;  readonly userFactors: Float32Array[];&#10;  readonly itemFactors: Float32Array[];&#10;  readonly implicitFactors: Float32Array[];&#10;  readonly userBias: Float32Array;&#10;  readonly itemBias: Float32Array;&#10;  readonly globalBias: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function predictSVDPlusPlus(&#10;  userId: number,&#10;  itemId: number,&#10;  model: SVDPlusPlusModel,&#10;  userImplicitItems: ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;,&#10;): number {&#10;  const norm = userImplicitItems.length &gt; 0 ? 1.0 / Math.sqrt(userImplicitItems.length) : 0;&#10;&#10;  const implicitSum = new Float32Array(model.userFactors[0].length);&#10;  for (const j of userImplicitItems) {&#10;    for (let f = 0; f &lt; implicitSum.length; f++) {&#10;      implicitSum[f] += model.implicitFactors[j][f];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let dot = 0;&#10;  for (let f = 0; f &lt; model.userFactors[userId].length; f++) {&#10;    const userComponent = model.userFactors[userId][f] + norm * implicitSum[f];&#10;    dot += model.itemFactors[itemId][f] * userComponent;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return model.globalBias + model.userBias[userId] + model.itemBias[itemId] + dot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SVDPlusPlusConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> factors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> learningRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> regularization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SVDPlusPlusModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> userFactors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> itemFactors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> implicitFactors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> userBias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> itemBias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> globalBias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> predictSVDPlusPlus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  itemId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SVDPlusPlusModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userImplicitItems</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userImplicitItems.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userImplicitItems.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> implicitSum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model.userFactors[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userImplicitItems) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> implicitSum.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      implicitSum[f] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.implicitFactors[j][f];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.userFactors[userId].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userComponent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.userFactors[userId][f] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> implicitSum[f];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.itemFactors[itemId][f] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userComponent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.globalBias </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.userBias[userId] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.itemBias[itemId] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"因子化机器-fm\">因子化机器 FM</h2><p>因子化机器（Factorization Machine, FM）是矩阵分解的泛化形式。矩阵分解只建模用户 ID 和物品 ID 两个特征的交互，而 FM 可以建模任意特征之间的二阶交互。FM 的预测公式为：<code>ŷ = w_0 + Σ w_i·x_i + Σ Σ &lt;v_i, v_j&gt;·x_i·x_j</code>，其中每个特征学习一个 k 维隐向量 v_i，交互项通过隐向量的内积计算。</p>\n<p>FM 的计算复杂度可以通过数学变换从 O(kn²) 优化到 O(kn)：<code>Σ Σ &lt;v_i, v_j&gt;·x_i·x_j = 1/2 Σ_{f=1}^{k} [(Σ v_{i,f}·x_i)² - Σ (v_{i,f}·x_i)²]</code>。这使得 FM 在高维稀疏特征上也能高效训练。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FMConfig {&#10;  readonly factors: number;&#10;  readonly learningRate: number;&#10;  readonly regularization: [number, number, number];&#10;  readonly epochs: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface FMModel {&#10;  readonly w0: number;&#10;  readonly weights: Float32Array;&#10;  readonly factors: Float32Array[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function fmPredict(features: ReadonlyArray&lt;{ index: number; value: number }&gt;, model: FMModel): number {&#10;  let prediction = model.w0;&#10;&#10;  for (const feat of features) {&#10;    prediction += model.weights[feat.index] * feat.value;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const k = model.factors[0]?.length ?? 0;&#10;  for (let f = 0; f &lt; k; f++) {&#10;    let sumSquare = 0;&#10;    let squareSum = 0;&#10;    for (const feat of features) {&#10;      const vf = model.factors[feat.index][f] * feat.value;&#10;      sumSquare += vf;&#10;      squareSum += vf * vf;&#10;    }&#10;    prediction += 0.5 * (sumSquare * sumSquare - squareSum);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return prediction;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FMConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> factors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> learningRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> regularization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FMModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 